From 8e820f01e8a750f800120c762f042a574d810bb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:59:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(pick): the box honours Pick through; MCP pick_in_box
 takes through

NeoTech's review of PR #1078:
- The viewport box reads state.pick_through (as feature_click does)
  instead of a hard-coded through: false; stale comments and the
  decision note updated. UI test the_box_honours_the_pick_through_toggle
  drives the box both ways (off: 4 top-rim chains; on: all 12).
- MCP pick_in_box takes an optional boolean through (default false =
  visible-only), passed to box_select_top; the description says a
  headless box without it is visible-only. Pinned by
  mcp_pick_in_box_is_visible_only_unless_through plus a refusal row.
- camcraft-mcp skill gains the pick_in_box row; PROCESS_VERSION 43 -> 44.
- The "Click selects" hint names the platform command key for the box
  (merged with main's click_selects_hint).

Refs #979

